WEBVTT

00:00:26.005 --> 00:00:30.119
change lives, and spark magic.

00:00:30.119 --> 00:00:35.003
Right now there is an aspiring teacher

00:00:35.003 --> 00:00:36.959
in a graduate school of education

00:00:36.959 --> 00:00:39.967
who is watching a professor babble on and on

00:00:39.967 --> 00:00:42.091
about engagement

00:00:42.091 --> 00:00:47.265
in the most disengaging way possible.

00:00:47.265 --> 00:00:48.915
Right now

00:00:48.915 --> 00:00:51.114
there's a first-year teacher at home

00:00:51.114 --> 00:00:53.666
who is pouring through lesson plans

00:00:53.666 --> 00:00:55.996
trying to make sense of standards,

00:00:55.996 --> 00:00:59.186
who is trying to make sense of how
to grade students appropriately,

00:00:59.186 --> 00:01:00.825
while at the same time saying to herself